						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div id="wiki-tabview-052bb7c15a487a07de3fb5fdd71c99e6" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Tales & Other</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>Here are my articles, listed in order of creation. If you like one enough to make art, please let me know, and I'll post it below. It's generally a good idea to start reading my articles beginning with 5466. Everything before that really isn't worth it, trust me.</p> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5035">SCP-5035</a> [[The Freedman]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>Director, that thing is sitting in stasis thinking about all of the different ways it can kill us.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This sucks, don't read it.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5061">SCP-5061</a> [[A Toast To Elizabeth Connors, A Brilliant Actress]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>You know, I was getting used to not having strange men stare at me in my dressing room.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This sucks don't read it.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5076">SCP-5076</a> [[Every Planet We Reach Is Dead]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>Sentient monkeys appear out of the sky and now fifteen-hundred people are missing? Oh, ape-man, you don't know the Foundation.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This sucks don't read it.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5093">SCP-5093</a> [[Damnatio Memoriae]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>I guess you're D-Class too, doc.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I'm okay with you reading this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5992">SCP-5992</a> [[The Dionysus Pit]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>What exactly are we containing here?</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Eh.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5269">SCP-5269</a> [[Exile]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>I don't have to think about her anymore.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I'm okay with you reading this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5466">SCP-5466</a> [[Death of the Creator]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>Contained. Imperfect. Finished. Complete</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5104">SCP-5104</a> [[Urgent Massage]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>'five red shapes'</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5818">SCP-5818</a> [[Frankenstein Burger King]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>Did I request thee, Maker, from my meat to mold me burger? Did I solicit thee from the kitchen to promote me?</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5175">SCP-5175</a> [[DEATH KNIFE]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>Prepare to be vanquished by DEATH KNIFE, bitches!</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>- a rewrite of an article by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/opmateo8080" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6722931&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="OpMateo8080" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6722931)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/opmateo8080" >OpMateo8080</a></span></em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5391">SCP-5391</a> [[Anastasis]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>The Veil has been lifted. This is now a war on all fronts.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This is the first part of the War on All Fronts Canon Renaissance contest output. Follow the hub on the article's page to read the series in order.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5437">SCP-5437</a> [[A Beast Cast From Heaven]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>They see the number five, or a starfish, and they think you start talking nonsense, but that's not the case. It never really is.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>War on All Fronts contest article.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5514">SCP-5514</a> [[The Dragonslayer]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>This has allowed it to 'pataphysically mantle the mytheme of the character archetype &quot;The Dragonslayer&quot;.</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>- a collaboration between <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3656445&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="Ellie3" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3656445)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" >Ellie3</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span>, and myself</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>War on All Fronts contest article.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5119">SCP-5119</a> [[Uncle Charlie's Toys and Games]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>I'm your Uncle Charlie, I have to know.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>It's ok.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5124">SCP-5124</a> [[playdo mous]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>playdo mous</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>playdo mous</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3651">SCP-3651</a> [[Chalk Children]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>There are wonderful things happening outside.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5787">SCP-5787</a> [[Bad Things Happen in Philadelphia]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>I wash ye with the blessing of the Wit Witout, the universal scales tip ever so even. Fucking whatever.</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>- a collab with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span></em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/eye-man">Eye-Man</a> [[A Parawatch Tale]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>If you know where to look, you'll find them. If you post about Eye-Man, they'll find you.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This is the only article I'm proud of.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/theosis">Theosis</a> [[A Parawatch Tale]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>I lived them. In seconds, I lived them all.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>I think I fell asleep while writing this.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/higher-minds">Higher Minds</a> [[A Parawatch Tale]]</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span><em>See that mural? You know exactly who runs this place.</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ►Author&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;"> ▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Read this.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p><strong>Art:</strong></p> <h3><span>SCP-5992- The Dionysus Pit</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/dr-dune-s-personnel-file/thepit.png" title="SCP-5992- The Dionysus Pit" alt="SCP-5992- The Dionysus Pit" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/curiousreader" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5699925&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053974" alt="CuriousReader" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5699925)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/curiousreader" >CuriousReader</a></span></p> <p><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span>SCP-5466- Death of the Creator</span></h3