span></h1> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/task-forces/Eta11.png"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/task-forces/Eta11.png/small.jpg" alt="Eta11.png" class="image" /></a></div> </div> <p><strong>Task Force Mission:</strong> Mobile Task Force Eta-11 specializes in the investigation, acquisition, and containment of auditory and musical anomalies, including any auditory cognitohazards or sound-based anomalous threats.</p> <p><strong>Assisting In Containment of Objects:</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1687">SCP-1687</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1844">SCP-1844</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2402">SCP-2402</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2828">SCP-2828</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3447">SCP-3447</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3519">SCP-3519</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Action Reports:</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-convincing-lyre">A Convincing Lyre</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/an-impenitent-thief">An Impenitent Thief</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/project-proposal-2014-2112">Project Proposal 2014-2112: &quot;Dreams of Failure&quot;</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/pattern-breaker">Pattern Breaker</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-musical-suspects">The Musical Suspects</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/counterpoint">Counterpoint</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/lockdown-procedures">Lockdown Procedures</a></li> </ul> <div style="text-align:right"> <p><sub><a href="#toc">Back to Top</a></sub></p> </div> </div> <p><a name="theta-4"></a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone series" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>MTF Theta-4 (&quot;Gardeners&quot;)</span></h1> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><a href="http://scp-wiki.