&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retcon:&lt;/strong&gt; Relating to the retroactively active ancient &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-140&quot;&gt;Daevite civilization&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teresa:&lt;/strong&gt; Relating to the interfaith NGO &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/manna-charitable-foundation-hub&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Manna Charitable Foundation.&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
