&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-4&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Potential Threat Entities are paranormal entities who are not yet considered Threats, but have a high likelihood of becoming Threats.&lt;/p&gt;
