&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/lte-0851-cetus&quot;&gt;Access LTE-0851-Cetus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/lte-8686-yellow-kewpie&quot;&gt;Access LTE-8686-Yellow-Kewpie&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/lte-5230-fiji-aurora-glory&quot;&gt;Access LTE-5230-Fiji-Aurora-Glory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lte-1969-blaecca-matrix-osmanthus-spiral&quot;&gt;Access LTE-1969-Blaecca-Matrix-Osmanthus-Spiral&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lte-4444-bosch-exmachina-goodrick-spiral&quot;&gt;Access LTE-4444-Bosch-ExMachina-Goodrick-Spiral&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lte-8118-moro&quot;&gt;Access LTE-8118-Moro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-6&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spurious Entries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Database entries that were later confirmed not to exist. Records maintained for archival purposes only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Threats&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Paranormal entities that are not considered Threats. Records maintained for observation and liaison purposes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persons of Interest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Non-paranormal persons of interest to the GOC due to their involvement with parathreats.&lt;/p&gt;
