&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome&lt;/strong&gt; to the &lt;strong&gt;Meatverse&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am putting some text here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please enjoy a quick tour through some of my most highly rated pieces. I have provided a short snippet about them and, far below, you will find a table that includes all of my works in chronological order. Thanks for your readership!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse&quot;&gt;SCP-4497: Whose Cuisine Reigns Supreme?! [+163]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse-border&quot;&gt;An esoteric adventure through the dream-scape of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4497&quot;&gt;SCP-4497&lt;/a&gt;, this piece explores the ultimate power over cookery&amp;#8230;if you have what it takes to defend the title!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse&quot;&gt;SCP-5600: A December To Remember [+148]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse-border&quot;&gt;My 5000 contest entry, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5600&quot;&gt;SCP-5600&lt;/a&gt; takes us home to small-town Wisconsin for Christmas and never, ever lets us leave. Learning to let go on December 32nd.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse&quot;&gt;SCP-5805: You Can&#039;t Go Back [+109]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse-border&quot;&gt;Although one of my shortest works, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5805&quot;&gt;SCP-5805&lt;/a&gt; packs a big punch aimed directly at a sense of loss and of nostalgia. The type of feeling that reminds you of summers past and friends no longer in your life, for whatever reason. This one&#039;s for you, Johnny. Wherever you are.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse&quot;&gt;SCP-4486 Happy Is Relative [+93]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;unfolded-collapse-border&quot;&gt;The legacy and history of Ronald McDonald is both goofy and very serious. &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4486&quot;&gt;SCP-4486&lt;/a&gt; explores a setting where the McDonald brothers created a friend to represent their love of their company and then lost control of him.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;center-collapse&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;All&amp;nbsp;listed&amp;nbsp;works&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Get&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;outta&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;no-addendum&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;center-collapse&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Authorial&amp;nbsp;Will&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Get&amp;nbsp;back&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;it&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the event of my unannounced disappearance from the Wiki for a period no shorter than six months, I wish for my written works to remain as I intended and only updated, changed, or refreshed in keeping with changes to the Themes or Components (etc) which may be used as part of their formatting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &amp;quot;IP&amp;quot; I have developed is of free use to the site as a whole, with the exception that I would like the content and direction of the &amp;quot;Late Stage Capitalism&amp;quot; Canon to pass into the care and curator-ship of DrAkimoto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If I appear absent or am unresponsive, please attempt to contact me by Wiki PM, IRC, Discord, or by reaching out to Wiki Staff and asking that they make an attempt to contact me before carrying out these wishes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2104082&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606053977&quot; alt=&quot;ManyMeats&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2104082)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats&quot;  &gt;ManyMeats&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
